# Break-glass IMAP accounts. Deliberately empty.
#
# Mailbox passwords live in mail_mailboxes.password_hash and are issued through
# POST /api/v1/mail/mailboxes/{id}/mail-password, which Dovecot reads via the SQL passdb in
# 10-auth.conf. This file is the second passdb in that list, consulted only when the SQL lookup
# returns nothing.
#
# That ordering is why an entry here is dangerous for a real mailbox: revoking a mail password nulls
# password_hash, the SQL query then returns no row, and Dovecot falls through to this file — so a
# leftover entry for the same address would keep working after being revoked in the console, with
# nothing in the UI to say so.
#
# Use it to reach the server while Postgres is down, then delete the line.
#
# Format: user@domain:{BLF-CRYPT}hash
# Generate: docker exec -it prabhix-mail-dovecot-1 doveadm pw -s BLF-CRYPT
